      "arguments": "{\"brief\":\"Should we open a second caf\u00e9 in Bristol next spring?\\n\\nJust use your best guesses and draft the model now.\",\"explicit_rebuild_request\":\"\",\"explicit_draft_request\":\"Just use your best guesses and draft the model now.\",\"whole_request\":true}",
